{"type":"FeatureCollection","municipality_code":"13402","pref":"東京都","city":"青ヶ島村","display_comment":"青ヶ島村には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは社寺・石碑・案内板に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では奥山治に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 さらに、「島寿司」や「焼酎（芋・麦）」といった名物や食文化に触れると、その土地らしい暮らしまで感じられるでしょう。","layer_counts":{"public_facilities":4,"cultural_facilities":1,"tourism_resources":5},"total_features":10,"features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"おじゃれセンター","category":"public","address":"青ヶ島村無","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"13402","municipality_pref":"東京都","municipality_name":"青ヶ島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.762215,32.467099]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"老人福祉館","category":"public","address":"青ヶ島村無","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"13402","municipality_pref":"東京都","municipality_name":"青ヶ島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.763447,32.46742]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"青ヶ島村老人福祉館","category":"public","address":"青ヶ島村無","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"13402","municipality_pref":"東京都","municipality_name":"青ヶ島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.7633142,32.4664592]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"青ヶ島村役場","category":"public","address":"青ヶ島村無","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"13402","municipality_pref":"東京都","municipality_name":"青ヶ島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.763337,32.466537]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"cultural_facilities","name":"青ケ島村立図書館","category":"public","address":"無番地","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_